<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraq's parliament approved the al-Zaidi cabinet amid growing economic concerns, while Iranian-backed IRGC forces said they are fully prepared on land, sea and air, and US sanctions tightened on Iran's economy targeting 16 people and 10 entities. Kataib Hezbollah warned it will target hostile aircraft over Iraq, and US sanctions were also linked to shadow banks and religious charity abuse. The conflict recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/16/iraq-parliament-approves-al-zaidis-cabinet-amid-growing-economic-concerns&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxONm9md2lxTWQ2OHhpbWV0TGVpVHNvRE94ejRhQmFaejFzOEFwNzF5ZG1YbXI4MDVJQU9UMGtZdEo4dUxmQ25Vc2Q3OU9qM1hWWDg4UTRoX3FSLTRxa1h3OFBFZnR2WGF1OUVtcEtNZ2dtRlpZQkpBdjF1NE9tdk93RGpRaGtfQnJYbktVeUQ4eGlXcjZHR2RmZHQtX1pVNWZ5Yi11TTdZSTFpdHBmcWItR29YM2xrSEVha0ZST2dTTnBFNkE1U2VvWk1rQnU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://newsroomamerica.com/?before=115246&quot;&gt;newsroomamerica.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://grenadachronicle.com/iraq-parliament-approves-al-zaidis-cabinet-amid-growing-economic-concerns/&quot;&gt;grenadachronicle.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.presstv.co.uk/Detail/2026/10/15/778411/IRGC--Iran%E2%80%99s-armed-forces-fully-prepared-on-land,-sea-and-air&quot;&gt;presstv.co.uk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bjtonline.com/business-jet-news/flying-into-risk-why-private-jet-travelers-need-a-backup-plan&quot;&gt;bjtonline.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.knau.org/2026-10-15/the-planned-public-execution-has-been-canceled-but-what-message-did-it-send&quot;&gt;knau.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gdnonline.com:443/Details/1409887/United-in-the-face-of-